cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "VIGIL: verifiable monitoring of official public-information portals"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
authors:
  - name: VectisDev
    email: security@vectis.dev
    website: "https://github.com/VectisDev"
repository-code: "https://github.com/VectisDev/Vigil"
url: "https://github.com/VectisDev/Vigil"
abstract: >-
  VIGIL preserves what an official public information portal publishes and
  makes a later alteration, or an outage, evident to a third party. The
  Honduras 2025 materials in this repository are a retroactive demonstration
  on public JSON. They are not a live chain of custody and they do not
  attribute intent to any party.
license: AGPL-3.0-only
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-01-02
keywords:
  - public-information
  - election-results
  - hash-chain
  - outage-monitoring
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.20598892
    description: >-
      Dataset of the Honduras 2025 public JSON captures. Not a DOI for this
      software tree.
